        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Derrickson, Doctor Strange\n- Places: Los Angeles, California\n- Works: Sinister, The Exorcism of Emily Rose, Deliver Us From Evil, Doctor Strange\n- Roles: director, screenwriter, producer, surgeon\n- Topics: horror films, Marvel Cinematic Universe, mystic arts\n\nFacts:\n- Scott Derrickson was born on July 16, 1966.\n- Scott Derrickson is an American director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Scott Derrickson lives in Los Angeles, California.\n- Scott Derrickson is best known for directing the horror films Sinister, The Exorcism of Emily Rose, and Deliver Us From Evil.\n- Scott Derrickson is also known for directing the 2016 Marvel Cinematic Universe film Doctor Strange.\n- In the 2016 film Doctor Strange, surgeon Stephen Strange learns the mystic arts after a career-ending car accident.",
